#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:5
#: 2c3bb0a1e93f465b85c4a4eeb9f48d58 3cb71cedf5844cb38b0b4d4ced3d4029
msgid "Barometer Temperature Compensation"
msgstr "气压计温度补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:9
#: 4173a6972f2a412484fc295cc5f255f6 76ad5e392d8b492ea0ce2b19146e555e
msgid ""
"Some small autopilots with very tightly packed components can suffer from "
"bad altitude control if the barometer suffers from significant changes in "
"reported pressure as the temperature changes.  The barometer temperature "
"compensation feature can be used to partially correct this issue."
msgstr ""
"部分组件排列紧密的小型飞控，若气压计受温度变化影响导致气压读数发生显著变化，可能会出现高度控制不良的问题。气压计温度补偿功能可以部分纠正此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:13
#: 1ddec58fdd454edd8d55e644b3408485 d7dd4886ed4847538c55114b32713447
msgid ""
"This feature is not useful for most autopilots including the Pixracer and "
"Pixhawk family of boards"
msgstr "此功能对大多数飞控无效，包括 Pixracer 和 Pixhawk 系列飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:17
#: 2fae7dc737504ebe8725a62debfeaeb1 8d502d0e05c840c586a0fbc380e1adb4
msgid "This feature is available in Copter-3.6 (and higher)"
msgstr "此功能在 Copter-3.6（及更高版本）中可用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:20
#: 90f0ff3f55bb44a8b934369ccc9b5a10 f6efb785244843d6b1f66b946ba85f1a
msgid "How to Use"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:22
#: 48a32c424685453ab3494b332e182eef 85456ce743cf4c05ab3394588281de8e
msgid ""
"set :ref:`TCAL_ENABLED <TCAL_ENABLED>` to 2 (to learn and use calibration)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`TCAL_ENABLED <TCAL_ENABLED>` 设置为 2（学习并使用校准）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:23
#: 7f15a5be18ab49f3b26cebef58784e61 aafbc0041e7a4417b3b0b0df63a4f7a9
msgid "power down the board and let it cool for a few minutes"
msgstr "关闭飞控并冷却几分钟"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:24
#: 5ce2963c678f46f097fd694860e648ed b7ce734a6bfc4520a555a0f42bbbd4ac
msgid "power on the board and leave it for about 10 minutes"
msgstr "上电并静置约 10 分钟"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:25
#: 432f704999cb46f98f542bd139c2b7f0 9b11671df51b4e0a9400e4f4982fdb50
msgid "learning will happen as the board heats up and while it is not moving"
msgstr "学习将在飞控升温且不移动时进行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:26
#: 803703630cd64275b476b29f7d460bcb c3aade92ef1048a4b100a746ca717107
msgid ""
"the :ref:`TCAL_BARO_EXP <TCAL_BARO_EXP>` should be updated with a non-zero "
"value"
msgstr ":ref:`TCAL_BARO_EXP <TCAL_BARO_EXP>` 应更新为非零值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-temp-comp.rst:27
#: 05684a7502fd421981c26bc3c702c1db cc6358a11ac74b8abdb300c683714316
msgid ""
"optionally turn off learning by setting :ref:`TCAL_ENABLED <TCAL_ENABLED>` "
"to 1 (to use but not learn new calibration values)"
msgstr "可选：将 :ref:`TCAL_ENABLED <TCAL_ENABLED>` 设置为 1 以停止学习（仅使用但不学习新校准值）"
